      <serviceTask name="Produce the daily maturity population"
                    id="_42bc5236-3e70-436c-a186-30a768f62fe6"
                    isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_42bc5236-3e70-436c-a186-30a768f62fe6"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-001; CSP-VQ-001.
 
Input: Current SYS-FAP accounting-position state, contractual value dates, and the applicable business-day calendar.
 
Handling: Produce the daily population of the latest eligible trade versions within the next five business days, including positions due today and matured positions that remain operationally incomplete. Include trade_id, trade_version, contractual value date, business_days_to_maturity, and maturity_status.
 
Keep maturity status separate from settlement status. Reaching the contractual value date does not prove that either currency leg has settled. The population remains subject to operational review against accepted trade versions, cancellations, and the operational lifecycle tracker.
 
Output: Daily maturity population available for review by Trade Operations and Settlement Operations.]]></documentation>
