      <userTask name="Validate settlement details for both currency legs"
                 id="_4df45fb8-a436-462f-8bbc-a32f375c8355"
                 isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_4df45fb8-a436-462f-8bbc-a32f375c8355"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-003; CSP-VQ-005.
 
Input: Reviewed maturity population classified as requiring settlement preparation, together with the applicable settlement reference data.
 
Handling: For each trade requiring preparation, validate both currency legs against the accepted trade version. Check the amounts, currencies, contractual value date, counterparty, settlement accounts, settlement instructions, and applicable cut-off times.
 
Identify missing, inconsistent, or outdated details requiring investigation or correction before submission. Keep affected trades outside the approved preparation population until the required details are resolved.
 
Output: Trades with both currency legs approved for settlement preparation, and any identified settlement preparation exceptions.
 
Approval at this stage confirms readiness to prepare settlemen instructions. It does not confirm submission or successful settlement.]]></documentation>
