      <endEvent name="Daily maturity review completed - no action required"
                 id="_81245052-b6f4-4c9d-8d81-01be325f7f99">
         <documentation id="documentation_81245052-b6f4-4c9d-8d81-01be325f7f99"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-002.
 
Outcome: The daily population review has established that no items require settlement preparation, monitoring, or exception investigation during this cycle.
 
This outcome completes the current review only. It does not assert that all trades have matured or that both currency legs of every trade have settled.]]></documentation>
