      <userTask name="Review trade versions and lifecycle eligibility"
                 id="_f835dae1-6098-4b33-97c8-f777484f29fd"
                 isForCompensation="false">
         <documentation id="documentation_f835dae1-6098-4b33-97c8-f777484f29fd"><![CDATA[Traceability: CSP-PR-004; CSP-ST-002.
 
Input: Daily maturity population, current SYS-FAP accounting-position state, and operational lifecycle tracker.
 
Handling: Review the listed trades against the latest accepted trade versions, cancellations, and recorded operational lifecycle state. Identify stale or superseded versions, cancelled trades, and inconsistent or unresolved lifecycle information requiring clarification.
 
Distinguish trades eligible for further settlement preparation from items requiring lifecycle ivnestigation or continued follow-up. Retain matured but operationally incomplete items for assessment; their presence does not authorise creation of replacement or duplicate settlement instructions.
 
Output: Population reviewed for trade-version and lifecycle eligibility, with identified exceptions, ready for Settlement Operations to assess the required settlement action.
 
This review does not approve settlement instructions or confirm that either currency leg has settled.]]></documentation>
